                                <div class="scratch-block control-block" id="n-block-3">
                                    <div class="header-line">
                                        如果 <span class="cond-tag">数字 <span class="val-tag">N</span> 除以 2 余 0</span> 那么
                                        <span class="status-indicator" id="n-status-3"></span>
